      <p class="_abstract">Create a VolumeGroupSnapshot object to capture point-in-time copies of multiple persistent volume claims (PVCs). Label the PVCs, specify the <code>VolumeGroupSnapshotClass</code>, and individual <code>VolumeSnapshot</code> objects are created automatically.</p>
      <p>When you create a <code>VolumeGroupSnapshot</code> object, OpenShift Container Platform creates a volume group snapshot.</p>
