      <CodeBlock code={"NAME        STATUS    VOLUME                                     CAPACITY   ACCESSMODES   AGE\npvc-0       Bound     pvc-a42d7ea2-e3df-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002   1Gi        RWO           48s\npvc-1       Bound     pvc-a42d81b8-e3df-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002   1Gi        RWO           48S"} lang="terminal" title="Example" />
